// "Amass [subtype] N" [CR#701.47a] — the canonical *composite* keyword action:
// it names no new engine primitive, it DECOMPOSES into ones the grammar already
// carries. Verbatim ([CR#701.47a]): "If you don't control an Army creature,
// create a 0/0 black [subtype] Army creature token. Choose an Army creature you
// control. Put N +1/+1 counters on that creature. If it isn't a [subtype], it
// becomes a [subtype] in addition to its other types."
//
// The four sentences map one-for-one onto core:
//   1. `If(Not(Exists(Army creature you control)), Create(... token ...))` — the
//      guard token, a 0/0 black creature whose subtypes are the amassed
//      `${0}` PLUS `Army` (spelled inline so the macro needs no pre-registered
//      subtype for `${0}`).
//   2. `With(ChooseOne(Army creature you control), …)` — bind the chosen Army as
//      `It` for the two clauses that follow. (After step 1 the token, if made,
//      is itself an Army creature you control, so the choice is always
//      satisfiable.)
//   3. `PutCounters(It, P1P1Counter, ${1})` — the growth.
//   4. `If(Not(Is(It, ${0})), Continuously(Modify(It, add ${0}), EndOfGame))`
//      — "becomes a [subtype] in addition": a one-shot-created continuous effect
//      with no stated duration ([CR#611.2a]) that adds the subtype, guarded so a
//      creature that is already that subtype is untouched.
//
// `${0}` is the amassed subtype NAME (a quoted `String`, e.g. "Orc"); `${1}` is
// N (a `Count`). An `OneShotEffect`-kind macro, so `Amass("Orc", 1)` (Orcish
// Bowmasters' "amass Orcs 1") stands as the effect body of any shell — an ETB
// trigger, an activated ability, or a spell.
(
    name: "Amass",
    template: "amass ${0} ${1}",
    kinds: [OneShotEffect],
    params: [String, Count],
    body: Sequentially([
        If(
            condition: Not(Exists(AllOf([
                Type(Creature),
                Subtype("Army"),
                ControlledBy(Ref(You)),
            ]))),
            then: Create(1, Token(
                color_indicator: [Black],
                types: [Creature],
                subtypes: [
                    Subtype(name: Param(0), types: [Creature, Kindred]),
                    Subtype(name: "Army", types: [Creature, Kindred]),
                ],
                power: 0,
                toughness: 0,
            )),
        ),
        With(
            binder: ChooseOne(filter: AllOf([
                Type(Creature),
                Subtype("Army"),
                ControlledBy(Ref(You)),
            ])),
            body: Sequentially([
                PutCounters(It, P1P1Counter, Param(1)),
                If(
                    condition: Not(Is(It, Subtype(Param(0)))),
                    then: Continuously(
                        effect: Modify(It, Subtypes(Add(Param(0)))),
                        duration: EndOfGame,
                    ),
                ),
            ]),
        ),
    ]),
)
